# Gypsy Beguiler

## Lore

The Gypsy Beguiler, or Gypsy Shapechanger, can wear another face. She can alter
her human appearance at will, make herself appear inhuman enough to frighten
people badly, or drop the shape entirely and become a wolf, a bear or an eagle -
anything larger than a house cat.

The animal shape is the easier of the two: cheaper to hold and it lasts for
hours. In it she keeps her own mind and gains the animal''s instincts, moving
faster and tracking by scent.

## Alignment

Any, although most are selfish or evil.

## GM Notes

Only **3%** of Gypsy Beguilers are literate in any language ' || char(8212) || ' the lowest rate in
a book that is full of low ones.

Her Hand to Hand can only ever become Assassin. Every other Gypsy class in the
book can train toward Martial Arts; this one cannot, which says something about
what the training is for.
', 'published', 'data-script'
